  <item>
    <title>004 海上即兴 | 在SIFF度过的那些六月</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6680cfcbcdd230b23b25740f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6680cfcbcdd230b23b25740f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Jun 2024 03:23:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2024年是我参加上海电影节的第十个年头，翻了翻盒子里的票根和周边，感慨万分。</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是在上影节落幕后的第一个礼拜，我抓来我的“电影搭子”——美丽的安凝小姐，来畅怀聊一聊我们每一年在上影节度过的那些个湿哒哒、却又无比感动的六月。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>2018年翻新前的上海影城</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj6bTklm0HpFXGpt0TEPAx-d--TG.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>2024年翻新后投入使用第二年的上海影城</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtCJcOsWyAfFA3PTGrvafyu8cU1w.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>2021年官方周边：影院徽章</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkN7D6ekE-BlyO_BJpmCYHF1wckI.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>提前十五分钟进场就领到美貌的限量票根（今年抢不到啦）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuCJoRytIGtRdEDEcfwsHHAeazFT.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>一些小小仪式感</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsxI1K9CctnDx9xvSjkfyH1sJUKS.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft4T0ont5rIb1yNh26wxlWBodMe_.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>2017年《低俗小说》映后见面会</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmJtbQHOkadmvwszRHVt3wJAPlPV.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>2023年《吾爱敦煌》映后见面会</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FheC4OCX-j582_Ox_tct76aUNpYF.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>2023年《你好，妈妈》映后见面会</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnooP1eyfNB3gb9KcVICqDJIhCyf.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>2024年影院印章合影</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtkiJBEGi1mkX3lqnr3bh-GuVw_y.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>光影落幕 唯爱不散</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjmu7xfjX5MrLRAXIID7RuV_JIQu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsuGSdQJEoHT1XOqpXrjU6OSsuQk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🍻特别感谢：下班赶回家陪我录制的安凝小姐</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期重点话题：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">03:43</a> &nbsp;作为“学生记者”参加上影节是一种什么感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> &nbsp;2024上影节个人抢票成绩公开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="652">10:52</a> &nbsp;抢票的你会以量取胜吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> &nbsp;安凝的本年度电影：增村保造</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> &nbsp;大梦的本年度电影：《海上传奇》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> &nbsp;来狠狠夸一夸「SIFF纪录片」单元</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 大梦的年度踩雷新片：《人造正义》《野兽》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a> &nbsp;过节嘛，就要安排属于自己的开场和结束~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1875">31:15</a> &nbsp;今年的“出警率”似乎特别高？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2315">38:35</a> 上影节场馆个人喜好度讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 领周边的乐趣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2935">48:55</a> 什么样的电影会被你列入“上影节人生影片”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 大梦的人生影片之一：《编舟记》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3384">56:24</a> 安凝的人生影片之一：《栖地》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3667">61:07</a> 大梦的人生影片之二：《人生果实》（含剧透分割线）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">67:00</a> 大梦其他历年人生影片：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>2017《天梯》《低俗小说》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>2018《你好，西蒙》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>2021《牡丹还魂》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>2023《吾爱敦煌》《你好，妈妈》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>2024《大红灯笼高高挂》</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4190">69:50</a> 安凝其他历年人生影片：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>2020《北京，你早》《小伟》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>2021《大地之歌》《薄荷糖》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>2023《葬礼》《末代皇帝》</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4500">75:00</a> 难抢系数和抢票策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5090">84:50</a> 谈一谈我们为什么热衷于赴约上海电影节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5352">89:12</a> 借着上影节的壳，过着吃美食的瘾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>🥢 大光明影院：荣家黄鱼面</span></p><span></span><p><span>🥢 上海影城：粮仓盖码饭、五观堂素食、十月红燕、O’mills、Alimentari、百丘、Fascino</span></p><span></span><p><span>🥢 虹桥艺术中心：金虹桥国际中心（爱虾乃家、静冈胜政日式猪排、APITA熟食）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🥢 上海商城剧院：尚牛社会、美新点心店（冷面！！！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🥢 艺海剧院：陕康里（Totino Panino、Homeslice）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🥢 新天地UME：Dip in Gelato、moofin、大时代美食面馆</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lm1p7as4mkA_UeeH9rHNIEfPbgNb.m4a" length="97461016" type="audio/mp4"/>
