  </item>
  <item>
    <title>003 新西兰见闻串烧：city walk，冷知识与好物种草</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65cf0ba70bef6c2074f0ee43</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65cf0ba70bef6c2074f0ee43</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 16 Feb 2024 07:15:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期我们真的聊了太多有意思的话题，从city walk聊到wine tour，从观鸟之旅聊到环保文化……绝对串烧本烧了，希望大家在新年假期的尾声，收听快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">2:40</a> 谁能想到新西兰还能city walk？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="637">10:37</a> 说到possum，这个动物真的非常可怜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="788">13:08</a> 新西兰crazy环保之一：鸡权运动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="933">15:33</a> 新西兰crazy环保之二：普卡基湖旁的山羊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1007">16:47</a> 新西兰crazy环保之三：鲁冰花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 瓦纳卡的餐厅很卷很好吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1512">25:12</a> 来到布伦海姆，你就不得不喝了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> 但尼丁看蓝企鹅，斯图尔特岛看鸟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2524">42:04</a> &nbsp;冷知识之“kiwi”的三重解读</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">44:30</a> 推送一条南岛自驾新思路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3057">50:57</a> 旅行嘛，总是有遗憾的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3397">56:37</a> 身在新西兰却吃不到新西兰好水果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3844">1:04:04</a> 非保姆级实用小贴士：App推荐+必备单品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4476">1:14:36</a> 真的很值得种草的伴手礼（也真的没人打钱</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsEihN5oTFySpkPfxMxn6U9XYL00.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在mt.Iron山间的小木屋可以俯瞰整个瓦纳卡</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lr8uCvh6an6aaU0hkJQ90XXmsm0L.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>好吃的鹿肉可颂（SCROGGIN）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqd_qsq_5wmbvLc5Ljjwp4hW4bPc.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>无敌好吃的披萨和宽意面（Francesca‘s Italian Kitchen）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv19bqY1OnRowFK_FbeuVfkPUDN4.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>油炸奇异果你不尝一个嘛（Eric’s fish&amp;chips）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi7OAcYm3Gog0hU4q_0S_k3ccJYI.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>普卡基湖配三文鱼刺身（mt.cook alpine salmon）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiIDv0KjJEwxbJp-7oIw3eK0n87a.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>马喜第一次去点了stupid hot的炸鸡，真的就stupid了🔥🌶️（firebird）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrzwRHIejjU-KHXN_iSWC7M_hyZq.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>逐渐走向疯狂的wine tour</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmKkoED-GYAcXIAGpddvbchKsVBX.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>这就是大梦很喜欢的那个logo</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhQlYUqPeZ3PMkSdpo4n4kqqVdbZ.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Great Kiwi Yarns，很好买</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnm2SJNn2UICpc7XZNbvWfByYf07.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>新西兰的书店里可以买到各种各样的“鸟书”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrTv1CV5bAMDIwuItY6BmqtgghuC.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在但尼丁看蓝企鹅时的晚霞</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luNusO4XN6JEtvmIaOPeNc8pvyHF.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>以及发不了动图的蓝企鹅们</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrI0EZaHXXGtOn8puGT7dYhOP_Se.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>蓝莓采摘实况🫐</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrdlFWoaTlU7Y9buG0IkJsZwBoh1.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>车厘子丰收转播🍒</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoAVQGBkxjY47DXtYgyekadgMXAa.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>画廊虽然都小小的，但都很好逛</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkQUTpI27BM4cNzOss9OG0X4jxHy.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>望远镜要记得带啊～</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🗺️提到的地名：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>瓦纳卡 Wanaka</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>普卡基湖 Lake Pukaki</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>布伦海姆 Blenheim</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>但尼丁 Dunedin</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>布拉夫 Bluff</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>因弗卡吉尔 Invercargill</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>斯图尔特岛 Stewart Island</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>乌瓦岛 Ulva Island</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>罗托鲁瓦 Rotorua</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>吉布斯农场 Gibbs Farm</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🍴提到的餐厅：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>早午餐：SCROGGIN（wanaka）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>炸鸡店：Firebird（wanaka）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>贝果店：鲁本贝果（wanaka）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>家庭式意大利料理：Francesca‘s Italian Kitchen（wanaka）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>创意料理：kika（wanaka）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>川菜馆：四川担担面（auckland）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>炸鱼薯条店：Eric’s fish&amp;chips（queenstown）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🛒提到的店：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>集合店： Revology（wanaka）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>服饰：Untouched World（wanaka &amp; auckland）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>书店：The Next Chapter（wanaka）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>画廊：gallery thirty three（wanaka）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>服饰：Great Kiwi Yarns（auckland）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>📖提到的书籍：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《All of this is for you》 by Ruby Jones</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《新西兰》by Lonely Planet</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵Bgm：&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《Waiting Room Fling》by 椅子乐队</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《Every Day Is Sunday》by 椅子乐队</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>自然鸟鸣 （大梦在新西兰公园录制）</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljPvX7NtrSuo5jBcRv90_TtAZMyy.m4a" length="78656773" type="audio/mp4"/>
