  <item>
    <title>002 新的一年，去新西兰做个野人吧！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65bf76b50847349e0cee0b4b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65bf76b50847349e0cee0b4b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Feb 2024 11:36:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：马喜</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目我和马喜花了两天复盘了彼此在新西兰那些闪光瞬间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本来想在新年前给大家献上一个“新西兰大礼包”，结果发现光是</span><strong><span>「户外」</span></strong><span>这个话题我俩就聊了四个多小时～</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以我决定把节目拆成两集，</span><strong><span>上集围绕户外运动，下集分享人文和美食。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这一期的前半个小时，我们交换了一下这个国家带给我们的真实感受；后一个小时，则大聊特聊各自喜欢的户外项目，掏心掏肺，童叟无欺！</span></p><span></span><p><span>想直接种草户外项目👉可以从<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a>之后开始听起，但如果愿意从头听到尾，我们保证那会是非常有趣的一个半小时时光。</span></p><span></span><p><span>新的一年，希望大家都能奔赴新的目的地。提前祝大家龙年快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">1:30</a> &nbsp;打工度假签证，一种很好的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">9:44</a> &nbsp;新西兰凭什么能美到令人“词穷”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> &nbsp;推荐几条舒舒服服的驾车路线🛣️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> &nbsp;跟着当地人去游野泳🏊，据说是释放野性的最佳契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1914">31:54</a> 皇后镇，户外小白的天堂：🪂滑翔伞、🚴山地自行车、🚡Luge</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> &nbsp;超五星推荐：地下萤火虫溶洞玩黑水漂流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> &nbsp;毛利小哥哥的“朦胧哲学”👓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4149">1:09:09</a> 大梦走出心流的入坑级徒步：胡克谷步道 hooker valley track</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4730">1:18:50</a> 马喜边走边“骂”的本莱蒙德步道 ben lomond track</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5015">1:23:35</a> 插播一段可爱对话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5087">1:24:47</a> 为了泡野温泉，挑战小众又危险的copland track</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5460">1:31:00</a> 户外虽好，但不要贪杯</span></p><span></span><p><span>🪂 户外项目清单：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.queenstownnz.co.nz/things-to-do/biking/mountain-biking/" data-url="https://www.queenstownnz.co.nz/things-to-do/biking/mountain-biking/"><span>山地自行车</span></a><span>：</span><a href="https://www.queenstownnz.co.nz/things-to-do/biking/mountain-biking/" data-url="https://www.queenstownnz.co.nz/things-to-do/biking/mountain-biking/"><span>www.queenstownnz.co.nz</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>Luge：</span><a href="https://www.skylineluge.com/en/" data-url="https://www.skylineluge.com/en/"><span>www.skylineluge.com</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.waitomo.com/black-water-rafting" data-url="https://www.waitomo.com/black-water-rafting"><span>怀托莫萤火虫洞黑水漂流</span></a><span> ：</span><a href="https://www.waitomo.com/black-water-rafting" data-url="https://www.waitomo.com/black-water-rafting"><span>www.waitomo.com</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🚶徒步路线：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>胡卡瀑布步道 huka falls track</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>胡克谷步道 hooker valley track</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>本莱蒙德步道 ben lomond track</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>科普勒步道 copland track</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>片头：《waitng Room Fling》椅子乐队</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>片尾：《我的美丽》小霞</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FopYNSFFBERwR0cqUd2NV6Od3vT9.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>马喜的电影感夏日时光（photo by 马喜）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnSNBZMtf_UqUdu4rOLMN6KRTPK_.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>大梦没有去成的绝美蓝泉（photo by 马喜）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj9On6xMlnca8sp2hYjFdMUPkpJJ.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>开往奥拉基/库克山的路上（photo by 大梦）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FovPOB2y8KTAxfGgZA-ZHs3eJnp0.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>更typical的新西兰：北岛草原（photo by 大梦）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrNs5d_0sd41Alr7wiKpIBf5romX.HEIC"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>胡克谷步道的大吊桥（photo by don哥）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrttOnkZOTTmdP_hBTvtYHB85akI.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>徒步中停下眺望库克峰（photo by 大梦）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lghpdZZTWzWYQ4RM77vEqDyA9XBZ.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>山地自行车（photo by 马喜）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmqFVqqnSH1SIcvAImMGAE-s5vPR.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>山地自行车（photo by 马喜）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkKEFhl_gKIIhJ15solEKp-LPyHM.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>随机跳水（photo by 马喜）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh71BKLtQn5zR9kKyqCoNvQ0Vw8s.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在bob‘s cove游野泳（photo by 马喜）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqDTh4ftoflH_FhvGcJTHT8Q230s.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>huhu chalet 古怪外观（photo by 大梦）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnjpUe_Z8pPqk5KsTMvi6-ke7FOu.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>huhu chalet 温馨内饰（photo by 大梦）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnUEg8zD-CNTzldaMzPfJvVWmKPW.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>huhu restaurant：慢炖羊肩肉（photo by 大梦）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lriqjLslUXpZAQDaGfEzBYzcyeGT.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>马喜在copland track遇到的志愿者老爷爷（这身板儿，惊！）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkcu7fXyhRGJQzZOiv7dsnmzESFx.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>登顶本莱蒙德步道山顶（photo by 马喜）</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
