    <title>001 三访京都，顶出旅行中的“彩色蘑菇”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65658fd3b95673db21676ea5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65658fd3b95673db21676ea5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Nov 2023 06:59:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🍄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> 本次京都旅行的「体验清单」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 京町屋之居住感受，舒国治与</span><strong><span>“元奈古”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 挖到宝藏民宿，旅程就像开了buff</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a> 在天蒙蒙亮的</span><strong><span>“大德寺”</span></strong><span>佛堂中上早课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> 惊喜环节：参观了以千利休设计一比一还原的茶室</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2013">33:33</a> </span><strong><span>“黄梅院”</span></strong><span>的三个庭院里最喜欢</span><strong><span>“破头庭”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2171">36:11</a> 名气很大的</span><strong><span>“琉璃光院”</span></strong><span>，体验如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> </span><strong><span>“無鄰菴”</span></strong><span>，和它不按套路出牌的业主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2636">43:56</a> 逛了六个器皿店，各有各的好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2806">46:46</a> 分享几个好棒棒的旅行小技能</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmiGNiYUnM6x-SRWyBS_kC3y18dS.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm77tHpxjm_mLUaxbkzujQb-KRMu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjHUKuZR9NbreRBxDhz-weEBlwpx.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqPpBEiq_vr8UBjgukD67IVI7q3W.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>京町屋改造的日式旅馆Karigane↓</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo45Jzmfzmcxen0Bvx-zLD8nHzn9.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>像是住在了日剧里↓</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrtjC6Q43o_2mHl2M6dzHYOa-yLP.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>人生第一次骑Tokyo bike是在Kyoto</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiyaxSGtPHiibUp7eWRDSPv3_yYD.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在晴朗的清晨骑车游鸭川↓</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrHqYGU-yqeb6mdnfrJLH4uqu-Av.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在大德寺上早课↓</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkV6jaGJFuDEx-D5nZSBjHW_TCtk.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>雨中的大德寺↓</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmMLveiptC51tEUkyupOYEQD4t7h.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>天授庵池塘里的倒影↓</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsNOEFyRPlzt017uef89PazolCP4.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>逆光下红了的枫叶↓</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgEBpgnWrthZk25bc85ubwIC6wft.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>無鄰菴的溪流、碎石与粉红天空倒影↓</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoOPD__ZpvFm5izYV5tqQNtM59M6.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>东山的落日↓</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpzbVjpYcvReaOzURy3X_-vAYcCH.JPG"></figure><span></span><h2><span>🙋🏻‍♂️ 提到的人物：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>舒国治</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>黑川雅之</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>千利休</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>织田信长</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>山县有朋</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小川治兵卫</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>柳宗悦</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>河井宽次郎</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>喜多源逸</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小野哲平&amp;二阶堂明弘</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小野象平</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>桥村大作</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>松原竜马</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>🪨 提到的庭院：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>龙源院</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>黄梅院：直中庭、破头庭、作仏庭</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>琉璃光院</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>無鄰菴</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>天授庵</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>永观堂</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>高台寺</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>🫖 提到的器皿店：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>若葉屋</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>器之彩</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>醒 XING</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>essencekyoto</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>うつわと古物幹（名字很长的古道具店）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>木と根 kitone</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>🎬 电影和书</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《门外汉的京都》舒国治</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《日本人的八个审美意识》黑川雅之</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《阴翳礼赞》谷崎润一郎</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《万葉集》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>电影《日日是好日》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>电影《寻访千利休》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>🎵 BGM</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《日常的镜头》by 椅子乐队</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
